==Rules==
{{ColosseumRule|High Speed}}

==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 66.67~70 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,100f</sup>.
*2 [[Metal One Horn]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 106.67~110 seconds<sup>3,200f~3,300f</sup>.
*1 [[Elizabeth the LVIth]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*2 [[Scissoroo]]s spawn after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Golem Sunfish]] spawns as the boss after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Super Metal Hippoe]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*2 [[Scissoroo]]s spawn after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>, delay 66.67~70 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Mr. Puffington]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
-
This is stage is pretty menacing, but using catasaurus or waitress cat can help deal with the metal enemies.

Another Startegy is to rush the stage. Use Manic lion, Fishman, A Bahamut, and any other good rushers. With good critters, you can kill the first metal enemies and rush the stage before the Puffington spawns.

